  - id: s_found
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: s_react
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "ミケが、見つかりました！神社の近くにいました。あなたが教えてくれた場所です！"
    textReading: "ミケが、みつかりました！じんじゃのちかくにいました。あなたがおしえてくれたばしょです！"
    textVi: "Tìm thấy Mike rồi! Nó ở gần đền thờ. Chính là chỗ mà bạn đã nhắc cho tôi đấy!"
    textEn: "We found Mike! She was near the shrine. Exactly where you told me!"
    textRomaji: "Mike ga, mitsukarimashita! Jinja no chikaku ni imashita. Anata ga oshiete kureta basho desu!"
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: bow
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: s_returned_asked
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: s_react
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "ミケは、自分で帰ってきました。心配してくれて、ありがとうございました。"
    textReading: "ミケは、じぶんでかえってきました。しんぱいしてくれて、ありがとうございました。"
    textVi: "Mike đã tự về nhà rồi. Cảm ơn bạn đã lo lắng cho tôi."
    textEn: "Mike came home on her own. Thank you for worrying about me."
    textRomaji: "Mike wa, jibun de kaette kimashita. Shinpai shite kurete, arigatou gozaimashita."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: bow
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: s_returned
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: s_react
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "ミケは、帰ってきました。今日は、元気です。"
    textReading: "ミケは、かえってきました。きょうは、げんきです。"
    textVi: "Mike đã về rồi. Hôm nay nó khỏe lắm."
    textEn: "Mike is back. She's full of energy today."
    textRomaji: "Mike wa, kaette kimashita. Kyou wa, genki desu."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: s_react
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: 
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Suzuki
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_2
    textJa: "ほら、あそこ。ミケも、お祭りに来ましたよ。赤いリボンをしています。"
    textReading: "ほら、あそこ。ミケも、おまつりにきましたよ。あかいリボンをしています。"
    textVi: "Kìa, ở đằng kia. Mike cũng đến lễ hội rồi. Nó đang đeo chiếc nơ đỏ."
    textEn: "Look, over there. Mike came to the festival too. She's wearing her red ribbon."
    textRomaji: "Hora, asoko. Mike mo, omatsuri ni kimashita yo. Akai ribon wo shite imasu."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: point
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
